<!--Post: 2693--><!--Time: 1103934474-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2693"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 4:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Q: There is something to be said for the &#34;inner voices&#34; that many serial killers say pushed them to kill. &#34;Son Of Sam&#34; &amp; &#34;The Gainsville Ripper&#34; are the biggest examples. It is a subject that no one can figure out, and most don&#39;t even believe. Our psychologists &amp; psychiatrists are just too primitive at this time to deal with it. <BR> <BR>But a defense of &#34;The devil made me do it.&#34; can also sound pretty ridiculous. Our legal system and the public at large has no patience for this area. So they&#39;ll probably just ignore it &amp; throw him in a cage &#40;prison&#41; for the rest of his life.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2693-->
<!--Post: 2698--><!--Time: 1103953032-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2698"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 9:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m Christian and the Bible speaks on this subject with clarity. <BR> <BR>There is another site where someone breaks BTKs claims of possesion down with scripture. i&#39;ll look for the link when I have more time and will post it here.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
